  (text "POWER AMP -- LM1875, gain 23x, feedback purely resistive (the IC needs a noise gain >= 10 at every frequency). HF -3dB 7.5 kHz from the INPUT low-pass R_lp / C_lp; LF ~17 Hz. Pin 3, decoupling, Zobel and D2 return on PGND." (at 146.68 11.11 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 846c38f6-1db0-415e-88ee-2cc3489faf58))
